{
  "id": "ACT.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ọrụ Ndị Ozi 2",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Open Igbo Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1980, 1988, 2019, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ọbịbịa nke Mmụọ Nsọ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ụbọchị Pentikọọsụ ruru, ha niile zukọtara nʼotu ebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mberede, ụzụ yiri nke oke ifufe dị ike sitere nʼeluigwe bịa jupụta nʼụlọ ahụ ha nọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha hụrụ ihe dịka ire ọkụ ka o kewara nọkwasị nʼisi ha nʼotu nʼotu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha niile jupụtara na Mmụọ Nsọ, malite ịsụ asụsụ dị iche iche dịka Mmụọ Nsọ nyere ha ike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼoge ahụ, ọtụtụ ndị Juu ji obi ọcha na-efe Chineke nọ na Jerusalem. Ndị si na mba dị iche iche nʼokpuru eluigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igwe mmadụ gbakọtara nʼọnọdụ mgbagwoju anya mgbe ha nụrụ ụzụ ahụ, nʼihi na ha nụrụ ka ha na-asụ asụsụ nke onye ọbụla nʼime ha na-aghọta, nʼasụsụ obodo ha dị iche iche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼoke iju anya, ha kwurịtara nʼonwe ha, \"Ndị a niile na-ekwu okwu ha abụghị ndị Galili?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gịnị mere onye ọbụla nʼime anyị ji na-anụ okwu ha na-ekwu nʼasụsụ ala anyị dị iche iche?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị Patia, na ndị Midia, na ndị Elam, ndị bikwa nʼime Mesopotamịa, ndị Judịa, na ndị Kapadosia, ndị Pọntọs, na ndị Eshịa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndị Frigia, na ndị Pamfilia, na ndị Ijipt, na ndị akụkụ Libiya nke dị Sirini nso, na ndị ọbịa si na Rom bịa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(ndị Juu na ndị kwere nʼokpukpe ndị Juu). Ndị Kriit na ndị Arab; anyị na-anụ okwu ha na-ekwu nʼasụsụ anyị dị iche iche banyere ọrụ ebube Chineke.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O juru ha anya, gbaakwa ha gharịị. Ha sịrịtara onwe ha, \"Gịnị ka nke a bụ?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ụfọdụ ndị ọzọ na-akwa ha emo na-asị, \"Ndị a bụ ndị mmanya na-egbu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwu Pita banyere Kraịst",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pita guzoro, ya na ndị ozi iri na otu ahụ welie olu gwa ọgbakọ ahụ okwu, \"Ndị Juu na unu ndị bi na Jerusalem, matanụ nke a, geekwanụ ntị na ihe m na-ekwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụghị mmanya na-egbu ndị a dị ka unu chere. Lee, ọ bụ naanị elekere itoolu nke ụtụtụ na-akụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mba, nke a bụ mmezu ihe Juel onye amụma kwuru,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Chineke sịrị, nʼoge ikpeazụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "aga m awụkwasị mmadụ niile Mmụọ m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ACT 2:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ụmụ unu ndị ikom na ụmụ unu ndị inyom ga-ebu amụma,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ụmụ okorobịa unu ga-ahụkwa ọhụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndị okenye nwoke unu ga-arọ nrọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụladị ndị ohu m, nwoke ha na nwanyị nʼime ha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ka m ga-awụkwasị Mmụọ m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ha ga-ebukwa amụma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga m egosi ihe ịtụnanya na mbara eluigwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gosikwa ihe ịrịbama nʼụwa na nʼokpuru ụwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ọbara na ọkụ na alulu anwụrụ ọkụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanwụ ga-agbanwe ghọọ ọchịchịrị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ọnwa ga-aghọkwa ọbara,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "tupu ụbọchị Onyenwe anyị abịa, bụ ụbọchị ahụ dị ukwu dịkwa ebube.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ ga-erukwa, na onye ọbụla nke na-akpọku",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "aha Onyenwe anyị, ka a ga-azọpụta.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ndị Izrel, geenụ ntị nʼokwu a, Jisọs onye Nazaret bụ nwoke Chineke gosiri unu, site nʼọrụ dị ike, nʼọrụ ebube nakwa ihe ịrịbama niile nke Chineke rụrụ nʼetiti unu site nʼaka ya, dịka unu ji anya unu hụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye a ka e weere nyefee unu nʼaka site na nzube nke Chineke buru ụzọ tụọ atụmatụ ya, na dịka o siri mara na mbụ, ọ bụ ya ka unu gburu ma kpọgidekwa nʼobe site nʼaka ndị na-amaghị iwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma Chineke emela ka o site nʼọnwụ bilie mgbe ọ tọpụchara ihe mgbu nke ọnwụ, nʼihi na ọnwụ enweghị ike ijide ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Devid kwuru banyere ya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ACT 2:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ana m ahụ Onyenwe anyị ka ọ na-anọgide nʼihu m mgbe niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na ọ nọ nʼaka nri m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Agaghị m ama jijiji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ọṅụ jupụtara m obi, ire m na-aṅụrịkwa ọṅụ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "anụ ahụ m ga-ezukwa ike nʼolileanya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nʼihi na ị gaghị ahapụ mkpụrụobi m nʼala mmụọ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ị gakwaghị ahapụ anụ ahụ nke Onye gị dị nsọ ka ọ hụ ire ure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mere ka m mara ụzọ nke ndụ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ị ga-emekwa ka m jupụta nʼọṅụ nʼihu gị.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ụmụnna m, eji m nkwuwa okwu na-agwa unu banyere nna nna anyị Devid, bụ onye nwụrụ anwụ e lie ya. Ili ya dịkwa nʼetiti anyị taa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ọ bụ onye amụma marakwa na Chineke jiri ịṅụ iyi kwee ya nkwa na otu nʼime ụmụ ya ga-anọkwasị nʼocheeze ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebe o buuru ụzọ hụ ihe ga-eme nʼoge dị nʼihu, o kwuru banyere mbilite nʼọnwụ nke Kraịst, mgbe ọ sịrị, a hapụghị ya nʼala mmụọ; anụ ahụ ya ahụghịkwa ire ure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụ Jisọs a ka Chineke mere ka ọ dị ndụ ọzọ. Anyị niile bụkwa ndị akaebe banyere ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebe ọ bụ na e buliela ya elu nʼaka nri Chineke. Ọ natala Mmụọ Nsọ dịka Nna ya kwere na nkwa. Ihe a unu na-ahụ na nke unu na-anụ bụ onyinye ya ọ wụkwasịrị anyị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ dịghị oge Devid jiri rigoro nʼeluigwe, ma ya onwe ya sịrị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ACT 2:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Onyenwe anyị gwara Onyenwe m sị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Nọdụ ala nʼaka nri m,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ruo mgbe m ga-eme ndị iro gị",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 2:35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ihe mgbakwasị ụkwụ nye ụkwụ gị.\" '",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ya mere, ana m eme ka ezinaụlọ Izrel niile mara nke ọma, na Chineke emeela Jisọs a onye unu kpọgidere nʼobe ka ọ bụrụ Onyenwe anyị na Kraịst.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ha nụrụ ihe ndị a, akọnuche ha mara ha ikpe. Ha sịrị Pita na ndị ozi ndị ọzọ, \"Ụmụnna, gịnị ka anyị ga-eme?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma Pita sịrị ha, \"Chegharịanụ unu niile. Ka e mekwa unu baptizim nʼaha Jisọs Kraịst, maka mgbaghara mmehie unu. Unu ga-anatakwa onyinye nke Mmụọ Nsọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwa a dịrị unu na ụmụ ụmụ unu na mmadụ niile nọ nʼebe dị anya, dịkwara ndị niile Onyenwe anyị Chineke ga-akpọ ka ha bịakwute ya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O jiri ọtụtụ okwu ndị ọzọ gbaa ama, ma dụọkwa ha ọdụ sị, \"Sitenụ nʼetiti ọgbọ a jọrọ njọ zọpụta onwe unu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E mere ndị nabatara okwu ya baptizim, ha dị ihe ruru puku mmadụ atọ, a gụnyere nʼọnụọgụgụ ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nnọkọ nke ndị kwere ekwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha nyefere onwe ha nʼozizi nke ndị ozi, ya na ife ofufe na ịnyawa achịcha nakwa ikpe ekpere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye ọbụla nʼime ha jupụtara na egwu, nʼihi na ndị ozi na-arụ ọtụtụ ọrụ ebube, na ihe ịrịbama dị iche iche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị niile kwere ekwe nọkọtara ọnụ, nwekọkwaa ihe niile ọnụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha rere ihe ha nwere na nke ha kpatara, kenye onye ọbụla dịka mkpa ya siri dị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha gara nʼihu na-ezukọta nʼụlọnsọ ukwu ikpe ekpere kwa ụbọchị. Ha na-erikọkwa nri nʼụlọ ha, nʼobi ọṅụ na ekele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dịka ha gara nʼihu na-eto Chineke, ha nwetara ihuọma nʼaka ndị mmadụ. Onyenwe anyị na-atụkwasịkwara ha ndị a na-azọpụta kwa ụbọchị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
